%% Meridian Diagram 10: Document Processing and RAG
flowchart TB
    classDef user fill:#F9F7D9,stroke:#B58B00,color:#2F2F2F,stroke-width:1px;
    classDef spring fill:#DCEBFF,stroke:#2C5AA0,color:#1E2A3A,stroke-width:1px;
    classDef fast fill:#E8F6FF,stroke:#0F6FA5,color:#173347,stroke-width:1px;
    classDef data fill:#E2F7E2,stroke:#2E7D32,color:#1F3A1F,stroke-width:1px;

    U[User Uploads PDF/TXT]:::user
    S[Spring Boot Upload Endpoint]:::spring
    F[FastAPI /documents/process]:::fast
    E[Extractor + Chunker\n512 tokens/chunk\n50 overlap]:::fast
    EM[Embedding Model\nvector 1536]:::fast
    DB[(PostgreSQL embeddings)]:::data

    U --> S
    S -->|validate ownership, type, size <= 10MB| S
    S -->|create document PROCESSING| DB
    S -->|multipart + X-Service-Key| F
    F --> E
    E -->|chunks| EM
    EM -->|insert vectors| DB
    F -->|chunk_count + ready| S
    S -->|document READY| U

    subgraph RAG[RAG Retrieval during Research/Chat]
      Q[Question]:::user --> V[embed question]:::fast
      V --> KNN[pgvector similarity search\nORDER BY embedding <=> query LIMIT top-k]:::fast
      KNN --> Ctx[Context chunks + scores]:::fast
      Ctx --> LLM[LLM answer synthesis]:::fast
    end

    DB --> KNN
